title: "wsf-archive-assembly: workflows to build the western US seasonal water supply forecast benchmark archive"
abstract: "Workflows that download, parse, harmonize and combine operational, hindcast, climatological and WSF Rodeo forecasts with naturalized observations into the wsf_archive_v1.0 NetCDF benchmark archive."
